version: "2026-11-16"
date-released: "2026-11-17"
abstract: >-
  An open, weekly-updated snapshot of MoneyPeel's small-software-business
  dataset: one row per product with its MRR band, 30-day revenue trend, pricing
  model, category and a one-line summary. Bands only, never point values; every
  full report carries the revenue evidence and the date it belongs to. Data is
  published under CC BY 4.0.
keywords:
  - startup revenue
  - SaaS revenue
  - MRR
  - startup growth
  - micro-SaaS
  - indie hackers
  - small software business
  - open dataset
  - business models
